│         "non_linear_items": ""                                               │
│     }                                                                        │
│ }                                                                            │
│ ```                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│ ## CRITICAL: Variable Count is PRE-DEFINED                                   │
│ - The `var` and `input` fields in  Initial Hybrid Automaton Specification    │
